23:- **Set: the list is exhaustive.** A specifier naming an unlisted provider fails at [model resolution](#model-resolution), and on the Cloudflare target the binding provider is registered only when the list names `'cloudflare'`. Naming `'cloudflare'` on the Node target is a config error (the binding only exists on Workers). Custom providers are unaffected — register those with [`setProvider()`](#setprovider).
