origin/main:.beads/issues.jsonl:36:{"id":"wt-391-forward-o0b.13","title":"1A.2a: static product declarations and trusted domain resolution","description":"Add a disabled-by-default server-only immutable graph for exact domain -> workspaceTypeId -> exactly one agentTypeId -> one trusted request/workspace-neutral behavior binding. Defensively copy/freeze; fail startup on invalid identifiers, normalized duplicate hosts, dangling/missing/duplicate bindings, or invalid default. Normalize only Fastify-derived hostname under explicit trustedProxy; exact hosts only. Typed mode is startup-mutually-exclusive with legacy requestScopeResolver/deployment authority. Full-app leaves mode disabled and accepts normal localhost/preview hosts. Add stable errors and export safety. No Better Auth multi-domain work, workspace selection, or behavior execution in this bead.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\nFocused config/hostname/proxy tests pass; typed mode and legacy requestScopeResolver are mutually exclusive; full-app disabled mode accepts normal hosts; stable errors registered; server-only export and no-resolver audits pass; package typecheck/tests, lint:invariants, git diff --check, proof summary, and independent security/spec review recorded.","acceptance_criteria":"Focused config/hostname/proxy tests pass; typed mode and legacy requestScopeResolver are mutually exclusive; full-app disabled mode accepts normal hosts; stable errors registered; server-only export and no-resolver audits pass; package typecheck/tests, lint:invariants, git diff --check, proof summary, and independent security/spec review recorded.","notes":"Historical only after merged PR #846. Current equivalent work lives under wt-391-forward-step1a-current-xn9; do not dispatch this singular-agent slice.","status":"closed","priority":1,"issue_type":"feature","estimated_minutes":360,"created_at":"2026-07-17T21:33:57.307650210Z","created_by":"ubuntu","updated_at":"2026-07-20T13:08:42.125710035Z","closed_at":"2026-07-20T13:08:42.125498499Z","close_reason":"Superseded before implementation by merged PR #846 and replacement graph wt-391-forward-step1a-current-xn9.","source_repo":"issue-391-plan-realignment","source_repo_path":"/home/ubuntu/projects/boring-ui-v2/.worktrees/issue-391-plan-realignment","compaction_level":0,"original_size":0,"labels":["391","auth","contracts","domain-routing","historical","superseded"],"dependencies":[{"issue_id":"wt-391-forward-o0b.13","depends_on_id":"wt-391-forward-o0b","type":"parent-child","created_at":"2026-07-17T21:33:57.307650210Z","created_by":"ubuntu","metadata":"{}","thread_id":""},{"issue_id":"wt-391-forward-o0b.13","depends_on_id":"wt-391-forward-o0b.12","type":"blocks","created_at":"2026-07-17T21:33:58.398976818Z","created_by":"ubuntu","metadata":"{}","thread_id":""}]}
origin/main:.beads/issues.jsonl:43:{"id":"wt-391-forward-o0b.2","title":"S1: immutable static agent declaration and behavior-binding contract","description":"Add one minimal immutable startup contract across existing Agent shared/server seams. Reuse AgentDefinition/AgentDeployment only as validated provenance: declaration agentId and definition reference must match, and static selection must never invoke deployment resolver/storage/publication/rollout state. Separate browser-safe declarations/catalog DTO from trusted server-only behavior bindings. Catalog exposure is a host option defaulting false. Validate safe unique IDs, one primary, route-base conflicts, missing/mismatched bindings, frozen input, and stable errors.\n\nBefore route code, produce a reviewed route-ownership table for every route currently aggregated by registerAgentRoutes, classifying Agent-owned chat/session/tool behavior versus shared files/fs-events/tree/search/deep-links/git/models/skills/plugin/UI surfaces. No runtime behavior, persistence, mutation API, dynamic registry, CAS, or compiler/resolver removal.\n\nProof: shared/server contract tests, serialization/export audit, invalid/duplicate/default/binding/deployment mismatch cases, no-resolver-invocation test, complete route inventory, package gates, independent API review.","status":"closed","priority":1,"issue_type":"feature","estimated_minutes":240,"created_at":"2026-07-17T14:00:34.030923491Z","created_by":"ubuntu","updated_at":"2026-07-17T21:31:15.660335837Z","closed_at":"2026-07-17T21:31:15.660139488Z","close_reason":"Superseded by owner-approved Decision 26 and docs/issues/391/plan.md: Step 1A now ships domain -> persisted workspace type -> one agent before same-workspace multi-agent. Retained history is non-dispatchable.","source_repo":"issue-391-plan-realignment","source_repo_path":"/home/ubuntu/projects/boring-ui-v2/.worktrees/issue-391-plan-realignment","compaction_level":0,"original_size":0,"labels":["391","contracts","multi-agent"],"dependencies":[{"issue_id":"wt-391-forward-o0b.2","depends_on_id":"wt-391-forward-o0b","type":"parent-child","created_at":"2026-07-17T14:00:34.030923491Z","created_by":"ubuntu","metadata":"{}","thread_id":""},{"issue_id":"wt-391-forward-o0b.2","depends_on_id":"wt-391-forward-o0b.1","type":"blocks","created_at":"2026-07-17T14:00:34.030923491Z","created_by":"ubuntu","metadata":"{}","thread_id":""}]}
origin/main:.beads/issues.jsonl:45:{"id":"wt-391-forward-o0b.21","title":"1A.10a: Seneca exact-pin two-product integration","description":"In a clean Seneca checkout, pin the exact 1A.9 registry cohort and integrate two exact product declarations, two persisted workspace types, and two agent behaviors derived from validated agents/<name> directories through explicit host tool catalog bindings. Prove application-level typed workspace UX, auth/type/proxy negatives, distinct prompts/tools/sessions, typecheck/tests/E2E/build/image, and exact lock integrity. Do not deploy production domains or execute rollback here; 1A.10b owns production proof. No selector, MCP/A2A, CAS/controller, workspace links, or private composer.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\nClean Seneca checkout pins exact registry cohort; two authored agents materially drive distinct runtime behavior/tools; typed zero/one/several/create/switch and auth/type negatives pass in app tests/E2E; typecheck/build/image smoke and lock integrity pass; no workspace links/private composer/Step2-3 work; proof and independent package/product review recorded.","acceptance_criteria":"Clean Seneca checkout pins exact registry cohort; two authored agents materially drive distinct runtime behavior/tools; typed zero/one/several/create/switch and auth/type negatives pass in app tests/E2E; typecheck/build/image smoke and lock integrity pass; no workspace links/private composer/Step2-3 work; proof and independent package/product review recorded.","notes":"Historical only after merged PR #846. Current equivalent work lives under wt-391-forward-step1a-current-xn9; do not dispatch this singular-agent slice.","status":"closed","priority":1,"issue_type":"feature","estimated_minutes":600,"created_at":"2026-07-17T21:33:58.177738758Z","created_by":"ubuntu","updated_at":"2026-07-20T13:08:43.647463920Z","closed_at":"2026-07-20T13:08:43.647278748Z","close_reason":"Superseded before implementation by merged PR #846 and replacement graph wt-391-forward-step1a-current-xn9.","source_repo":"issue-391-plan-realignment","source_repo_path":"/home/ubuntu/projects/boring-ui-v2/.worktrees/issue-391-plan-realignment","compaction_level":0,"original_size":0,"labels":["391","domain-routing","historical","product-proof","seneca","superseded"],"dependencies":[{"issue_id":"wt-391-forward-o0b.21","depends_on_id":"wt-391-forward-o0b","type":"parent-child","created_at":"2026-07-17T21:33:58.177738758Z","created_by":"ubuntu","metadata":"{}","thread_id":""},{"issue_id":"wt-391-forward-o0b.21","depends_on_id":"wt-391-forward-o0b.20","type":"blocks","created_at":"2026-07-17T21:33:59.390374324Z","created_by":"ubuntu","metadata":"{}","thread_id":""}]}
origin/main:.beads/issues.jsonl:75:{"id":"wt-391-forward-o0b.22","title":"1A.2b: prove two-domain authentication topology","description":"Using the config/domain seam from 1A.2a, make the chosen Seneca-compatible auth topology real: host-only Secure/HttpOnly cookies on each product domain, explicit trusted origins and callback/base URL behavior, SameSite/CSRF, logout/revocation, and forwarded scheme/host handling. Users may authenticate separately per domain; do not add a shared parent-domain cookie. Social/OAuth callbacks are not promised until separately configured and proven. No workspace selection yet.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\nReal-browser or highest public-seam tests prove sign-in/session/logout on two exact domains, sibling-domain cookie isolation, CSRF/origin denial, trusted/untrusted forwarded scheme/host, callback/base URL behavior and disabled full-app compatibility. Focused auth tests/typecheck, lint:invariants, diff check, redacted evidence, rollback and independent security review recorded.","acceptance_criteria":"Real-browser or highest public-seam tests prove sign-in/session/logout on two exact domains, sibling-domain cookie isolation, CSRF/origin denial, trusted/untrusted forwarded scheme/host, callback/base URL behavior and disabled full-app compatibility. Focused auth tests/typecheck, lint:invariants, diff check, redacted evidence, rollback and independent security review recorded.","notes":"Historical only after merged PR #846. Current equivalent work lives under wt-391-forward-step1a-current-xn9; do not dispatch this singular-agent slice.","status":"closed","priority":1,"issue_type":"feature","estimated_minutes":300,"created_at":"2026-07-17T21:39:47.931780833Z","created_by":"ubuntu","updated_at":"2026-07-20T13:08:43.816505539Z","closed_at":"2026-07-20T13:08:43.816301851Z","close_reason":"Superseded before implementation by merged PR #846 and replacement graph wt-391-forward-step1a-current-xn9.","source_repo":"issue-391-plan-realignment","source