origin/main:.beads/issues.jsonl:78:{"id":"wt-391-forward-o0b.25","title":"1A.6b: integrate A1 materialized source into sole behavior binding","description":"Consume reviewed A1.2 MaterializedAgentSourceV1 through the exact sole-behavior/lifecycle seam landed by .17. Map source instructions/tools once; do not compile directories or resolve catalogs again. Enforce final collisionPolicy error across standard/authored/plugin tools and prove prompt/tool/readiness/log attribution in the real runtime. Generic packages never import Seneca executable modules.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\nA1 MaterializedAgentSourceV1 maps into the exact .17 behavior contract once; authored instructions change captured real runtime prompt; resolved tools execute; standard/authored/plugin collisions fail before model work; readiness/log attribution is trusted; no compiler/catalog duplication, second composer, selector, bundle/CAS/deployment authority; focused Core/Workspace/Agent tests/typechecks, invariants, diff check, proof/rollback and Sol-high package/security review are clean.","acceptance_criteria":"A1 MaterializedAgentSourceV1 maps into the exact .17 behavior contract once; authored instructions change captured real runtime prompt; resolved tools execute; standard/authored/plugin collisions fail before model work; readiness/log attribution is trusted; no compiler/catalog duplication, second composer, selector, bundle/CAS/deployment authority; focused Core/Workspace/Agent tests/typechecks, invariants, diff check, proof/rollback and Sol-high package/security review are clean.","notes":"Historical only after merged PR #846. Current equivalent work lives under wt-391-forward-step1a-current-xn9; do not dispatch this singular-agent slice.","status":"closed","priority":1,"issue_type":"feature","estimated_minutes":360,"created_at":"2026-07-17T21:39:48.637314485Z","created_by":"ubuntu","updated_at":"2026-07-20T13:08:44.253007968Z","closed_at":"2026-07-20T13:08:44.252766592Z","close_reason":"Supers