origin/main:.beads/issues.jsonl:83:{"id":"wt-391-forward-c0u.2","title":"A1.1: materialized authored-source server contract","description":"Add server-only MaterializedAgentSourceV1 and materializeAgentDirectory() over compileAgentDirectory(). Contract fields: schemaVersion 1, agentTypeId, version, optional label, instructions, tools, declaredToolRefs. Enforce product ID grammar/expected ID, verified instructions, frozen output, no runtime effects. Ref-free returns tools []; any non-empty toolRefs fails AUTHORED_AGENT_CATALOG_REQUIRED until A1.2. Reject capability/skill/MCP refs as AUTHORED_AGENT_REFERENCE_UNSUPPORTED. Freeze codes: AUTHORED_AGENT_ID_INVALID, AUTHORED_AGENT_TYPE_MISMATCH, AUTHORED_AGENT_CATALOG_REQUIRED, AUTHORED_AGENT_REFERENCE_UNKNOWN, AUTHORED_AGENT_REFERENCE_UNSUPPORTED, AUTHORED_AGENT_TOOL_INVALID, AUTHORED_AGENT_TOOL_COLLISION. AgentCliErrorV1 is {schemaVersion:1,ok:false,error:{code,field?,message}}.\n\n## Rollback\nRevert the additive Agent server export/types/codes; no stored state or authored files change.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\nValid ref-free directory returns exact frozen source/instructions and tools []; non-empty tool refs fail catalog-required; invalid ID/mismatch/unsupported refs use exact codes; compiler errors retain codes; mutation tests pass; server export positive and shared/front negatives pass; no digest/path/root/catalog/runtime leak. Run `pnpm --filter @hachej/boring-agent build`, `pnpm --filter @hachej/boring-agent typecheck`, `pnpm --filter @hachej/boring-agent test`, `pnpm lint:invariants`, `pnpm check:golden-path`, `git diff --check`; attach changed files/output/rollback/residual risks; Sol-high API/security review CLEAN.","acceptance_criteria":"Valid ref-free directory returns exact frozen source/instructions and tools []; non-empty tool refs fail catalog-required; invalid ID/mismatch/unsupported refs use exact codes; compiler errors retain codes; mutation tests pass; server export positive and shared/front negatives pass; no digest/path/root/catalog/runtime leak. Run `pnpm --filter @hachej/boring-agent build`, `pnpm --filter @hachej/boring-agent typecheck`, `pnpm --filter @hachej/boring-agent test`, `pnpm lint:invariants`, `pnpm check:golden-path`, `git diff --check`; attach changed files/output/rollback/residual risks; Sol-high API/security review CLEAN.","notes":"Historical only after merged PR #846 (085836f53). Do not dispatch. Replacement graph: wt-391-forward-step1a-current-xn9. #814 remains corrective migration input; #816/#817/Seneca #16 architecture is superseded.","status":"closed","priority":1,"issue_type":"feature","estimated_minutes":360,"created_at":"2026-07-18T08:56:59.092795338Z","created_by":"ubuntu","updated_at":"2026-07-20T13:08:37.850812901Z","closed_at":"2026-07-18T10:40:57.303108273Z","close_reason":"Implemented and merged in PR #813 at 6c32d16e; GPT-5.5 worker proof passed and independent Sol-high review APPROVE/CLEAN.","source_repo":"issue-391-plan-realignment","source_repo_path":"/home/ubuntu/projects/boring-ui-v2/.worktrees/issue-391-plan-realignment","compaction_level":0,"original_size":0,"labels":["805","a1","agent","contracts","historical","superseded"],"dependencies":[{"issue_id":"wt-391-forward-c0u.2","depends_on_id":"wt-391-forward-c0u","type":"parent-child","created_at":"2026-07-18T08:56:59.092795338Z","created_by":"ubuntu","metadata":"{}","thread_id":""},{"issue_id":"wt-391-forward-c0u.2","depends_on_id":"wt-391-forward-c0u.1","type":"blocks","created_at":"2026-07-18T08:57:00.400638678Z","created_by":"ubuntu","metadata":"{}","thread_id":""}]}
origin/main:.beads/issues.jsonl:84:{"id":"wt-391-forward-c0u.3","title":"A1.2: trusted tool allowlists and collision-safe merge","description":"Extend materializeAgentDirectory() as the sole tool catalog resolver using a trusted per-agent ReadonlyMap allowlist. Resolve refs once in declaration order. Strict validator covers safe name, nonempty description, non-array schema object, valid readiness requirements, execute function. Add mergeTools collisionPolicy last-wins|error; preserve last-wins default and use error for authored/dev across standard/authored/plugin tools. Never dynamic-import authored modules.\n\n## Rollback\nRevert catalog resolution/strict validator/collision option; compatibility merge remains prior last-wins behavior; no persisted state.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\nRef-free/valid allowlist pass; absent catalog/ref, invalid name/description/schema/readiness/execute, duplicate output and standard/authored/plugin collisions fail exact frozen codes; last-wins compatibility tests unchanged; error fails before runtime; outputs frozen; import spy proves no authored tool module load. Exact commands: `pnpm --filter @hachej/boring-agent build`; `pnpm --filter @hachej/boring-agent typecheck`; `pnpm --filter @hachej/boring-agent test`; `pnpm lint:invariants`; `pnpm check:golden-path`; `git diff --check`. Record output/rollback/residual risks; Sol-high security review CLEAN.","acceptance_criteria":"Ref-free/valid allowlist pass; absent catalog/ref, invalid name/description/schema/readiness/execute, duplicate output and standard/authored/plugin collisions fail exact frozen codes; last-wins compatibility tests unchanged; error fails before runtime; outputs frozen; import spy proves no authored tool module load. Exact commands: `pnpm --filter @hachej/boring-agent build`; `pnpm --filter @hachej/boring-agent typecheck`; `pnpm --filter @hachej/boring-agent test`; `pnpm lint:invariants`; `pnpm check:golden-path`; `git diff --check`. Record output/rollback/residual risks; Sol-high security review CLEAN.","notes":"Historical only after merged PR #846 (085836f53). Do not dispatch. Replacement graph: wt-391-forward-step1a-current-xn9. #814 remains corrective migration input; #816/#817/Seneca #16 architecture is superseded.","status":"closed","priority":1,"issue_type":"feature","estimated_minutes":420,"created_at":"2026-07-18T08:56:59.311345387Z","created_by":"ubuntu","updated_at":"2026-07-20T13:08:38.761115711Z","closed_at":"2026-07-20T13:08:38.760802273Z","close_reason":"Superseded by merged PR #846 and replacement graph wt-391-forward-step1a-current-xn9; preserve branch/PR evidence only.","source_repo":"issue-391-plan-realignment","source_repo_path":"/home/ubuntu/projects/boring-ui-v2/.worktrees/issue-391-plan-realignment","compaction_level":0,"original_size":0,"labels":["805","a1","agent","historical","security","superseded","tools"],"dependencies":[{"issue_id":"wt-391-forward-c0u.3","depends_on_id":"wt-391-forward-c0u","type":"parent-child","created_at":"2026-07-18T08:56:59.311345387Z","created_by":"ubuntu","metadata":"{}","thread_id":""},{"issue_id":"wt-391-forward-c0u.3","depends_on_id":"wt-391-forward-c0u.2","type":"blocks","created_at":"2026-07-18T08:57:00.540219244Z","created_by":"ubuntu","metadata":"{}","thread_id":""}]}
origin/main:.beads/issues.jsonl:85:{"id":"wt-391-forward-c0u.4","title":"A1.3: boring-ui agent validate CLI","description":"Add `boring-ui agent validate <dir>`. Human output reports ID/version/label/instructions byte length/declared refs without content/paths. JSON success is {schemaVersion:1,ok:true,agent:{agentTypeId,version,label?,instructions:{present:true,byteLength},refs:{tools,capabilities,skills,mcpServers}}}; JSON failure is AgentCliErrorV1. Directory validation reports refs but never claims runtime resolution or deployment provenance.\n\n## Rollback\nRemove the additive `agent validate` branch/help/DTO; existing CLI commands and authored directories remain unchanged.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\nSubprocess tests cover valid human/JSON, malformed/schema/missing/traversal/symlink/UTF8, invalid ID, refs reporting, exact envelopes/codes/fields/exits and redaction; existing help/commands green. Exact commands: `pnpm --filter @hachej/boring-agent build`; `pnpm --filter @hachej/boring-agent test`; `pnpm --filter @hachej/boring-ui-cli build`; `pnpm --filter @hachej/boring-ui-cli typecheck`; `pnpm --filter @hachej/boring-ui-cli test`; `pnpm lint:invariants`; `pnpm check:golden-path`; `git diff --check`. Record output/rollback/residual risks; Sol-high spec/security review CLEAN.","acceptance_criteria":"Subprocess tests cover valid human/JSON, malformed/schema/missing/traversal/symlink/UTF8, invalid ID, refs reporting, exact envelopes/codes/fields/exits and redaction; existing help/commands green. Exact commands: `pnpm --filter @hachej/boring-agent build`; `pnpm --filter @hachej/boring-agent test`; `pnpm --filter @hachej/boring-ui-cli build`; `pnpm --filter @hachej/boring-ui-cli typecheck`; `pnpm --filter @hachej/boring-ui-cli test`; `pnpm lint:invariants`; `pnpm check:golden-path`; `git diff --check`. Record output/rollback/residual risks; Sol-high spec/security review CLEAN.","notes":"Historical only after merged PR #846 (085836f53). Do not dispatch. Replacement graph: wt-391-forward-step1a-current-xn9. #814 remains corrective migration input; #816/#817/Seneca #16 architecture is superseded.","status":"closed","priority":1,"issue_type":"feature","estimated_minutes":300,"created_at":"2026-07-18T08:56:59.558492360Z","created_by":"ubuntu","updated_at":"2026-07-20T13:08:38.128488654Z","closed_at":"2026-07-18T18:44:32.389349226Z","close_reason":"Implemented and merged via PR #815 at 7a21d3580; GPT-5.5/Sol loop final APPROVE/CLEAN.","source_repo":"issue-391-plan-realignment","source_repo_path":"/home/ubuntu/projects/boring-ui-v2/.worktrees/issue-391-plan-realignment","compaction_level":0,"original_size":0,"labels":["805","a1","authoring","cli","historical","superseded"],"dependencies":[{"issue_id":"wt-391-forward-c0u.4","depends_on_id":"wt-391-forward-c0u","type":"parent-child","created_at":"2026-07-18T08:56:59.558492360Z","created_by":"ubuntu","metadata":"{}","thread_id":""},{"issue_id":"wt-391-forward-c0u.4","depends_on_id":"wt-391-forward-c0u.2","type":"blocks","created_at":"2026-07-18T08:57:00.664770464Z","created_by":"ubuntu","metadata":"{}","thread_id":""}]}
origin/main:.beads/issues.jsonl:86:{"id":"wt-391-forward-c0u.5","title":"A1.4a: embeddable local dev-app seam and capture harness","description":"Add embeddable dev-app API consuming already materialized source, explicit local workspace, runtime policy and dispatcher callback—no catalog input. Map source instructions/tools once into existing Workspace/Agent options. Disable external plugins/plugin authoring/ambient skills by default. Use collision policy error. Add purpose-built capture harness proving exact model prompt and resolved test-tool invocation; scripted harness stays lifecycle-only. Preserve one existing Workspace+Sandbox composer/disposal.\n\n## Rollback\nRemove the additive dev-app/capture seam; existing folder/workspaces modes and runtime lifecycle remain unchanged; no user workspace deletion.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\nCapture tests assert authored prompt/tool/context, ref-free/pre-materialized tools; ambient resources absent by default; one runtime/disposal; collisions fail pre-model; no second composer/final behavior type/deployment path. Exact commands: `pnpm --filter @hachej/boring-agent build`; `pnpm --filter @hachej/boring-agent typecheck`; `pnpm --filter @hachej/boring-agent test`; `pnpm --filter @hachej/boring-workspace build`; `pnpm --filter @hachej/boring-workspace typecheck`; `pnpm --filter @hachej/boring-workspace test`; `pnpm --filter @hachej/boring-ui-cli test`; `pnpm lint:invariants`; `pnpm check:golden-path`; `git diff --check`. Record output/rollback; Sol-high architecture/security review CLEAN.","acceptance_criteria":"Capture tests assert authored prompt/tool/context, ref-free/pre-materialized tools; ambient resources absent by default; one runtime/disposal; collisions fail pre-model; no second composer/final behavior type/deployment path. Exact commands: `pnpm --filter @hachej/boring-agent build`; `pnpm --filter @hachej/boring-agent typecheck`; `pnpm --filter @hachej/boring-agent test`; `pnpm --filter @hachej/boring-workspace build`; `pnpm --filter @hachej/boring-workspace typecheck`; `pnpm --filter @hachej/boring-workspace test`; `pnpm --filter @hachej/boring-ui-cli test`; `pnpm lint:invariants`; `pnpm check:golden-path`; `git diff --check`. Record output/rollback; Sol-high architecture/security review CLEAN.","notes":"Historical only after merged PR #846 (085836f53). Do not dispatch. Replacement graph: wt-391-forward-step1a-current-xn9. #814 remains corrective migration input; #816/#817/Seneca #16 architecture is superseded.","status":"closed","priority":1,"issue_type":"feature","estimated_minutes":420,"created_at":"2026-07-18T08:56:59.755775720Z","created_by":"ubuntu","updated_at":"2026-07-20T13:08:38.913216637Z","closed_at":"2026-07-20T13:08:38.913042054Z","close_reason":"Superseded by merged PR #846 and replacement graph wt-391-forward-step1a-current-xn9; preserve branch/PR evidence only.","source_repo":"issue-391-plan-realignment","source_repo_path":"/home/ubuntu/projects/boring-ui-v2/.worktrees/issue-391-plan-realignment","compaction_level":0,"original_size":0,"labels":["805","a1","agent","cli","historical","superseded","workspace"],"dependencies":[{"issue_id":"wt-391-forward-c0u.5","depends_on_id":"wt-391-forward-c0u","type":"parent-child","created_at":"2026-07-18T08:56:59.755775720Z","created_by":"ubuntu","metadata":"{}","thread_id":""},{"issue_id":"wt-391-forward-c0u.5","depends_on_id":"wt-391-forward-c0u.3","type":"blocks","created_at":"2026-07-18T08:57:00.799313276Z","created_by":"ubuntu","metadata":"{}","thread_id":""}]}
origin/main:.beads/issues.jsonl:88:{"id":"wt-391-forward-c0u.7","title":"A1.5: packed conformance and authoring documentation freeze","description":"Complete A1 with minimal example and validate -> materialize -> dev proof. Pack actual Agent/CLI tarballs into clean consumer; server import positive and shared/front behavior import negatives; installed-bin validate/dev smoke; import scan proves no authored executable module. Align Boring and Seneca authoring docs with no deployment/digest authority.\n\n## Rollback\nRestore last-known-good authored directory/per-type binding and prior exact compatible package cohort; never map non-default type to primary; preserve later agent namespaces/history; revert fixtures/docs before release or publish corrective versions after release.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\nClean package and relevant full-app compatibility tests pass; authored changes alter captured prompt/tool; tarball consumer and installed-bin smokes pass; no authored module import; Boring/Seneca docs agree. Exact commands: `pnpm --filter @hachej/boring-agent build`; `pnpm --filter @hachej/boring-agent typecheck`; `pnpm --filter @hachej/boring-agent test`; `pnpm --filter @hachej/boring-ui-cli build`; `pnpm --filter @hachej/boring-ui-cli typecheck`; `pnpm --filter @hachej/boring-ui-cli test`; `pnpm --filter full-app typecheck`; `pnpm --filter full-app test`; `pnpm lint:invariants`; `pnpm check:golden-path`; `git diff --check`. Record tarball versions/commands/output/rollback/residual risks; Standards/Spec/Thermo and Sol-high final review CLEAN.","acceptance_criteria":"Clean package and relevant full-app compatibility tests pass; authored changes alter captured prompt/tool; tarball consumer and installed-bin smokes pass; no authored module import; Boring/Seneca docs agree. Exact commands: `pnpm --filter @hachej/boring-agent build`; `pnpm --filter @hachej/boring-agent typecheck`; `pnpm --filter @hachej/boring-agent test`; `pnpm --filter @hachej/boring-ui-cli build`; `pnpm --filter @hachej/boring-ui-cli typecheck`; `pnpm --filter @hachej/boring-ui-cli test`; `pnpm --filter full-app typecheck`; `pnpm --filter full-app test`; `pnpm lint:invariants`; `pnpm check:golden-path`; `git diff --check`. Record tarball versions/commands/output/rollback/residual risks; Standards/Spec/Thermo and Sol-high final review CLEAN.","notes":"Historical only after merged PR #846 (085836f53). Do not dispatch. Replacement graph: wt-391-forward-step1a-current-xn9. #814 remains corrective migration input; #816/#817/Seneca #16 architecture is superseded.","status":"closed","priority":1,"issue_type":"feature","estimated_minutes":420,"created_at":"2026-07-18T08:57:00.154992488Z","created_by":"ubuntu","updated_at":"2026-07-20T13:08:39.198279593Z","closed_at":"2026-07-20T13:08:39.198120053Z","close_reason":"Superseded by merged PR #846 and replacement graph wt-391-forward-step1a-current-xn9; preserve branch/PR evidence only.","source_repo":"issue-391-plan-realignment","source_repo_path":"/home/ubuntu/projects/boring-ui-v2/.worktrees/issue-391-plan-realignment","compaction_level":0,"original_size":0,"labels":["805","a1","conformance","docs","historical","packages","superseded"],"dependencies":[{"issue_id":"wt-391-forward-c0u.7","depends_on_id":"wt-391-forward-c0u","type":"parent-child","created_at":"2026-07-18T08:57:00.154992488Z","created_by":"ubuntu","metadata":"{}","thread_id":""},{"issue_id":"wt-391-forward-c0u.7","depends_on_id":"wt-391-forward-c0u.6","type":"blocks","created_at":"2026-07-18T08:57:01.193186297Z","created_by":"ubuntu","metadata":"{}","thread_id":""}]}
