origin/main:.beads/issues.jsonl:212:{"id":"wt-391-forward-gh912-live-transcript-8r4g.7","title":"V3 implement static live controls and Markdown integrity","description":"## Fixed product contract\nImplement GitHub #912 only: /live start \"title\", /live stop, /live status; compact explicit consent; one statically composed singleton; one live session/microphone owner per workspace in one owning app process; stream-only audio to private pinned Kyutai/Moshi stt-1b-en_fr through an authenticated same-origin backend proxy; no audio retention; one timestamped non-diarized Markdown artifact read-only in the live UI; revision-safe projection at most once/second; browser socket close is terminal; only one upstream Kyutai restart; same originating chat stays usable and receives changed-only hidden reviews at +60s then +120s; exact NO_LIVE_RECOMMENDATION is suppressed. Flag remains off until final owner approval.\n\n## Non-goals\nNo MediaRecorder, chunks, upload, playback, pause/resume, browser reconnect, reload/crash recovery, diarization, transcript cards, modes, provider abstraction, generic audio/WebSocket/job/hidden-turn platform, distributed lease, dynamic provider mounting, query credentials, or old recording subsystem integration. Transcript text is untrusted. Stable errors, Workspace-only file access, and repository import invariants apply.\n\n## Scope\nUsing passed G3 evidence, statically mount one internal live controller above all chat panes; implement exact parser for /live start title, /live stop, /live status; compact fixed consent; live status strip with always-available Stop; narrow pre-admission for only stop/status while busy; immutable originating chat; path-scoped read-only UI binding; and revision/hash conflict controls. Cancel has zero file/media/network effects. Do not request microphone or enable accepting routes yet.\n\n## Acceptance/proof\nParser/local interception tests prove commands never reach Pi. Split-pane singleton, busy stop/status, unrelated command blocked, consent/cancel, active-path lock and every terminal unlock, external mutation byte preservation/CAS conflict tests pass. Flag off hides all UI. Run focused agent/workspace tests/typechecks/audits and git diff --check.\n\n## Exact command and consent contract\nAccept only `/live start \\\"<non-empty title>\\\"`, `/live stop`, and `/live status`. Reject unknown subcommands, missing/extra arguments, unquoted/empty titles, pause, and a second start with no side effects. Show exactly: `Audio is streamed to our self-hosted Kyutai service for transcription; this app and service are configured not to retain it.` Confirmation must precede file creation, lease claim, getUserMedia, and socket creation; Cancel performs none.\n\n## Runnable proof\nCommands: `pnpm --filter @hachej/boring-agent test`; agent typecheck; workspace test/typecheck; `pnpm audit:imports`; `git diff --check`. Record exact parser, composer-policy, singleton, consent, lock and CAS test paths.","acceptance_criteria":"Exact grammar/disclosure and zero-side-effect cancellation pass; commands never reach Pi; one controller per tab across split panes and immutable origin pass; stop/status work while busy and unrelated command remains blocked; V3 opens/locks only the exact server-returned path and never establishes authoritative filesystem path/collision policy; active-path lock/unlock and external mutation CAS conflict preserve bytes. Commands: pnpm --filter @hachej/boring-agent test; pnpm --filter @hachej/boring-agent typecheck; pnpm --filter @hachej/boring-workspace test; pnpm --filter @hachej/boring-workspace typecheck; pnpm audit:imports; git diff --check. Record exact files/outputs.","status":"closed","priority":1,"issue_type":"task","created_at":"2026-07-23T22:07:13.488797060Z","created_by":"ubuntu","updated_at":"2026-07-24T07:14:04.829219662Z","closed_at":"2026-07-24T07:14:04.828919010Z","close_reason":"Superseded before implementation by reviewed local CPU V0 slices; no product code from these units was started.","source_repo":"issue-912-minimal-live-transcript","source_repo_path":"/home/ubuntu/projects/boring-ui-v2/.worktrees/issue-912-minimal-live-transcript","compaction_level":0,"original_size":0,"labels":["912","flag-off","frontend","implementation","markdown"],"dependencies":[{"issue_id":"wt-391-forward-gh912-live-transcript-8r4g.7","depends_on_id":"wt-391-forward-gh912-live-transcript-8r4g","type":"parent-child","created_at":"2026-07-23T22:07:13.488797060Z","created_by":"ubuntu","metadata":"{}","thread_id":""},{"issue_id":"wt-391-forward-gh912-live-transcript-8r4g.7","depends_on_id":"wt-391-forward-gh912-live-transcript-8r4g.3","type":"blocks","created_at":"2026-07-23T22:07:15.390859898Z","created_by":"ubuntu","metadata":"{}","thread_id":""},{"issue_id":"wt-391-forward-gh912-live-transcript-8r4g.7","depends_on_id":"wt-391-forward-gh912-live-transcript-8r4g.5","type":"blocks","created_at":"2026-07-23T22:07:15.650275905Z","created_by":"ubuntu","metadata":"{}","thread_id":""}]}
